                    insight_renewable:      `Renewable academy: all four KPIs clear their thresholds — NPS ≥65, margin ≥25%, marquee utilisation within the safe cap, on-time delivery healthy. You delivered tailored-at-scale: a strong core, a thin configured local layer, and a bench that survives. This is the engagement that earns the $13M three-year academy.`,
                    insight_crowdpleaser:   `Loss-making crowd-pleaser: NPS is high but margin is below the dean's 25% floor. You recreated last year's flagship — a delighted client and money lost. The dean will not sign this, and a happy first cohort does not earn the renewal.`,
                    insight_generic:        `Margin-safe but generic: you held the margin floor by stripping the experience, and NPS fell below ≥65. Helvetia feels it bought an open-enrolment course; the Middle East escalates and the three-year academy goes to a rival.`,
                    insight_burned:         `You burned the bench: marquee utilisation pushed past the safe cap. Win this engagement and you lose the faculty you need for the other 54 — and the two professors who warned they would step back may now do so.`,
                    insight_late:           `On-time delivery is fragile: a risky rollout pattern put the six-month launch deadline at risk across five time zones. A pilot-then-scale or staggered sequence would have de-risked the spread.`,
                    insight_target:         `You reached the unit's 32% target margin while keeping the client delighted — exceptional balance, not just clearing the floor.`,
                    insight_misscoped:      `Mis-scoped: both NPS and margin fell short. Revisit Round 1 — most likely you accepted too much bespoke or over-standardised, and never qualified what was genuinely Helvetia-specific.`,

